## Define guarded version deletion policy

Context: Domain-version cards need pure capability data for lifecycle actions
and safe deletion. The policy now centralizes role, readiness, loaded-version,
latest-version, and minimum-version safeguards for later UI and service use.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/registry/version_lifecycle.py
   Added transition capability metadata and guarded version-deletion policy helpers.
2. tests/units/registry/test_version_lifecycle.py
   Added lifecycle capability and safe-deletion policy coverage.

